[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    26[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Findings:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    27[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    28[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * The single public function is `void hsl_to_rgb(float *, const float *)`.
