[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     20[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ```
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     21[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     22[0m:[38;5;10m[49m The configuration surface is therefore entirely the **shape and value class of
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     23[0m:[38;5;10m[49m the 3-float input**, crossed with the **buffer geometry** of the two pointers.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     24[0m:[38;5;10m[49m The axes the C actually branches on:
