[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     40[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     41[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ### 2. Null-pointer behaviour under `-C debug-assertions`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     42[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
